\title[Higher-Dimensional Pythagorean Trees]{Higher-Dimensional Pythagorean Trees:\\
Lorentz Reflections, the Harmonic Branching Law,\\ and the Growth Constant $(\sqrt{n}+1)/(\sqrt{n}-1)$}

